      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDY GRANT (2) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 0.9 lengths from Waltzing Diablo in second (22.12) at Ballarat. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Good form should continue. IVORY PANKE (6) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 0.9 lengths win at this track in a handy 24.21. Jumping from the pinch draw but likes the trip. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. DAINTREE MAGGIE (1) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Traralgon over 350m behind Vacation Calling (20.41) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. Worth another chance. MADAM SERIOUS (7) won as expected last time – another big run is on the cards.",
